    <li>iPhones and mid-to-high-range Androids from the last 3-4 years get meaningful quotes.</li>
    <li>Storage size, colour, and condition all move the number.</li>
    <li>Factory-reset before pickup if you can; if not, data destruction is routed instead.</li>
    <li>Cracked-screen phones may still qualify at a reduced quote.</li>
    <li>Payment on the spot for accepted quotes — cash, UPI, or bank transfer.</li>
  </ul>

